{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36348","headline":"山中寄吴磻十韵 · 方干","name":"山中寄吴磻十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫问终休否，林中事已成。\n盘餐怜火种，岁计付刀耕。\n掬水皆花气，听松似雨声。\n书空翘足卧，避险侧身行。\n果傍闲轩落，蒲连湿岸生。\n禅生知见理，妻子笑无名。\n更拟教诗苦，何曾待酒清。\n石溪鱼不大，月树鹊多惊。\n砌下通樵路，窗间见县城。\n云山任重叠，难隔故交情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}